---
<section style="background:#f9fafb; padding: 40px 20px;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
    
    <h2 style="text-align: center; color: #0b5ed7; margin-bottom: 24px;">Sabhi Brands Ki Service</h2>
    
    <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; justify-content:center;">
      
      <!-- Har brand ka link uske alag page par le jayega -->
      <a href="/kent-service" class="brand-btn">Kent</a>
      <a href="/aquaguard-service" class="brand-btn">Aquaguard</a>
      <a href="/pureit-service" class="brand-btn">Pureit</a>
      <a href="/ao-smith-service" class="brand-btn">AO Smith</a>
      <a href="/livpure-service" class="brand-btn">Livpure</a>
      <a href="/havells-service" class="brand-btn">Havells</a>
      <a href="/blue-star-service" class="brand-btn">Blue Star</a>
      <a href="/faber-service" class="brand-btn">Faber</a>
      <a href="/nasaka-service" class="brand-btn">Nasaka</a>
      <a href="/hindware-service" class="brand-btn">Hindware</a>

    </div>
    
    <p style="text-align:center; margin-top:24px; color:#6b7280;">
      Aapka brand list mein nahi hai? Call karein — hum har brand ki service karte hain.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Buttons ka design aur hover effect */
  .brand-btn {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #374151;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  
  .brand-btn:hover {
    border-color: #0b5ed7;
    color: #0b5ed7;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(11, 94, 215, 0.15);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
</style>